[00:11.45]1. Jehovah God is my Shepherd;
[00:22.91]I’ll follow where he will lead.
[00:34.36]He knows my hopes and my heart’s desire;
[00:40.86]He knows what I truly need.
[00:47.36]To watered pastures he leads me,
[00:53.85]To places secure and blessed.
[01:00.45]And he guides me always with loyal love
[01:06.95]To where I find peace and rest.
[01:13.63]He guides me always with loyal love
[01:20.03]To where I find peace and rest.
[01:30.52]2. Refreshing are all your pathways,
[01:36.52]The ways of your righteousness.
[01:42.52]For your name’s sake never let me stray
[01:49.48]From walking in faithfulness.
[01:56.44]In valleys deep in the shadows,
[02:02.44]Assured by your staff and rod,
[02:08.44]I will fear no danger of lasting harm,
[02:15.44]For you are my Friend and God.
[02:22.75]I fear no danger of lasting harm,
[02:28.91]For you are my Friend and God.
[02:38.68]3. Jehovah, you are my Shepherd;
[02:45.18]I follow where you will lead.
[02:51.84]You strengthen me, and you give me rest;
[02:58.24]You give all I truly need.
[03:04.84]As you most surely are living,
[03:11.34]So sure is my hope in you.
[03:17.95]May your loyal love and your care for me
[03:24.29]Pursue me my whole life through.
[03:31.00]Your loyal love and your care for me
[03:37.40]Pursue me my whole life through.